#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0648 expect=violation domain=TP
#note "Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules v2.0 CG0648 (Rule: TP dataset not present; not used in human clinical trials). The study ships a TP dataset -> the anchored presence check fires once, on its anchor."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset TP class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Paths"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RPATHCD type=Char label="Planned Repro Path Code"
col RPATH   type=Char label="Planned Repro Path"
---
S1 | TP | P1 | MATING AND GESTATION
